contents['research.html']=intro('Research & development','Better connections.<br><em>New possibilities.</em>','Exploring how applications, services and information can work together in more useful ways.')+'<div class="wide-art">'+connected+'</div><div class="content-grid"><div><h2>Connected applications.</h2><p>Software rarely exists in isolation. The way applications exchange information and fit into everyday workflows can be as important as the applications themselves.</p><p>Our R&D focus explores these connections: how ideas can be tested, how integrations can be made clearer and how connected experiences can support practical needs.</p><div class="research-note">This is a research direction. Concepts shown here are illustrative and do not represent announced product features.</div></div><div><h2>Questions worth exploring.</h2><ul class="line-list"><li><span>01</span>How can separate applications become a coherent experience?</li><li><span>02</span>Where can clearer information flows reduce unnecessary work?</li><li><span>03</span>What can a focused prototype help us understand?</li></ul><a class="text-link" style="margin-top:25px" href="contact.html?subject=Connected%20applications">Discuss a connected idea '+arrow()+'</a></div></div>'+cta()
